### HTTP request sample, for the REST Client style of .http file.
### Each block separated by ### is a separate request.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@version = v1
@token = PLACEHOLDER_TOKEN_NOT_REAL
@themeId = 42

### List published themes

GET {{baseUrl}}/{{version}}/themes?published=true&per_page=20 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Request-Id: 7f3c1a90-0b2e-4d5f-9a11-6c8e2d4b0f31

### Fetch a single theme

GET {{baseUrl}}/{{version}}/themes/{{themeId}} HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a swatch

POST {{baseUrl}}/{{version}}/themes/{{themeId}}/swatches HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "label": "keyword",
  "hex": "#C792EA",
  "fontStyle": "normal",
  "scopes": [
    "keyword",
    "storage.type",
    "storage.modifier"
  ]
}

### Partially update a theme

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{version}}/themes/{{themeId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "isPublished": true,
  "rating": 4.75
}

### Upload a packaged extension

POST {{baseUrl}}/{{version}}/themes/{{themeId}}/package HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----BoundaryABC123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

------BoundaryABC123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Initial release
------BoundaryABC123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="theme.vsix"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./dist/theme.vsix
------BoundaryABC123--

### Delete a swatch

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{version}}/themes/{{themeId}}/swatches/7 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GraphQL over HTTP

POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "query": "query GetTheme($themeId: ID!) { theme(themeId: $themeId) { id name uiTheme } }",
  "variables": { "themeId": "42" }
}
